solarman-bridge (1.1.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * http { bind } sets the listen address; the template binds 127.0.0.1 so
    the dashboard is reached through a reverse proxy on the host.
  * Inverter commands log the client from X-Forwarded-For when proxied.

 -- Alexey Volokitin <elenaluk89@gmail.com>  Thu, 15 Oct 2026 23:50:00 +0300

solarman-bridge (1.0.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release. Monitors Deye hybrid inverters through their Solarman
    WiFi loggers: native Solarman V5 / Modbus RTU client on the dispatcher,
    one poller per inverter, live data every second.
  * Several inverters, one config section each; inverter models are one
    file each in src/models/ (deye_sg04lp3 so far).
  * SQLite history: one sample per 5 s kept 30 days, daily energy from the
    inverter's own counters kept for good, per inverter.
  * Dashboard on port 8081: Realtime power flow with per-node tables,
    History charts, Energy pies and daily bars per month (one inverter or
    all), Info. JSON API under api/.
  * Inverter on/off commands, off unless enabled in the config.

 -- Alexey Volokitin <elenaluk89@gmail.com>  Thu, 15 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0300
